5. Training data

The original recruitment-email training, validation, benchmark,
and evaluation datasets are private and are not included in this
public release.

No private email bodies, subjects, recruiter information,
application identifiers, or private datasets are redistributed
as part of this project.


6. Model provenance

The published model is a fine-tuned and quantized derivative of
Microsoft Multilingual-MiniLM-L12-H384.

The model is intended for job-title extraction from recruitment
emails. It is not an employment decision system and should not be
used as the sole basis for employment decisions.
